{{!
    @template theme_dimensions/navbar_phonemenu

    The user menu entries that stand in for the navbar's controls on a phone ({@see \theme_dimensions\local\phonenav}).
    The theme's core renderer appends this to navbar_plugin_output(), inside #usernavigation, as an inert holder:
    amd/src/phonemenu.js moves the entries to the top of the user menu's main panel, where core's markup has no slot of
    its own, and scss/phonenav.scss hides each control the menu then holds, below md only. Without the module the
    holder stays inert and the navbar keeps every control.

    Each entry is the markup core's user_action_menu_item_link writes, so core's user menu module and Bootstrap's
    dropdown keyboard handling treat it as theirs. An entry that stands for an action (focus mode, edit mode) is a link
    to the page itself; the module runs the hidden control's own action instead. A counted entry carries an empty badge,
    which the module fills from the hidden control's own count each time the menu opens.

    Context variables required for this template (described without braces, because a Mustache
    comment closes at the first pair of closing braces it meets):

    * entries - The entries, each: key (messages, mail, focus or edit), url, isaction, icon (Font Awesome classes),
      label (plain), counted (whether it shows an unread count)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "entries": [
            {
                "key": "messages",
                "url": "https://example.com/message/index.php",
                "isaction": false,
                "icon": "fa-regular fa-comment",
                "label": "Messages",
                "counted": true
            },
            {
                "key": "focus",
                "url": "#",
                "isaction": true,
                "icon": "fa-solid fa-book-open-reader",
                "label": "Focus mode",
                "counted": false
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<template data-region="dimensions-phonemenu">
    {{#entries}}
    <a href="{{url}}" class="dropdown-item dimensions-phonemenu-item" role="menuitem" tabindex="-1"
        data-dimensions-phone="{{key}}"{{#isaction}} data-action="dimensions-phonemenu-action"{{/isaction}}>
        <i class="icon {{icon}} fa-fw" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span class="dimensions-phonemenu-label">{{label}}</span>
        {{#counted}}
        <span class="dimensions-phonemenu-count" data-region="dimensions-phonemenu-count" aria-hidden="true" hidden></span>
        <span class="visually-hidden" data-region="dimensions-phonemenu-unread"></span>
        {{/counted}}
    </a>
    {{/entries}}
    <div class="dropdown-divider dimensions-phonemenu-divider" role="presentation"></div>
</template>
